    "rules": [
      "Dark fantasy RPG art direction: weathered verdigris, restrained antique gold, parchment typography. No bright dashboard-blue default styling.",
      "Use serif display typography for hero names and lore; sans for HUD labels and controls. Preserve hierarchy and quiet negative space.",
      "Main CTA uses three textured states. Nine-slice panel corners are 12px; do not stretch their corner ornament.",
      "Free-position portrait card and CTA preserve their exact placement unless a review explicitly permits layout edits.",
      "Stats are a horizontal automatic layout. Move the parent container, not the positions of its individual children.",
      "Original vector illustration is a concept-level asset. Final game art quality requires separate human art-direction acceptance."
    ]
  },
